-- TikTok listing SKUs the read pass saw, their matched variant, warehouse and quantity, why one is held,
-- and S2's last push), the switch "Sinkronkan stok ke TikTok" on tiktok_shop_connections (default false),
-- and the cursor resource `products` (the read pass's health row).
